Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,zhushi,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,OP,,0,0,0,,OP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.61,0:00:52.76,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,強力凜然振翅高飛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.00,0:01:07.84,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,像這樣與你相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.14,0:01:13.06,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,並不是只為了生存下去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.27,0:01:19.86,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,小小的誓言超越時空
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.23,0:01:24.87,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,必定會改變未來的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.43,0:01:28.32,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,LIMITER　（changing myself）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.32,0:01:31.50,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,釋放出來　（changing youself）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.61,0:01:37.39,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,迸發吧　天使的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.78,0:01:41.35,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,拯救世界 「翼」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.35,0:01:44.20,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我現在選擇的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.42,0:01:50.63,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要抓住夢幻（停不下來）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.73,0:01:53.51,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,被賦予的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.51,0:01:56.14,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,向著天空迫近
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.16,0:02:01.94,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,強力凜然振翅高飛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.24,0:02:07.79,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐　my wings
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,ED
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.87,0:22:34.45,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}面向未來　擁抱夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.45,0:22:38.44,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}下定決心　仰望天空
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.44,0:22:44.50,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}用我的翅膀跨越未來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.50,0:22:48.42,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}你才是我命中注定之人 !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.42,0:22:52.34,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}我宣布　絕對love !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.34,0:22:58.30,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}閃亮的季節漸漸逝去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.98,0:23:03.03,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}紀念照裡的你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.03,0:23:06.97,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}是那一成不變的　困惑的表情
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.53,0:23:13.81,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}溫柔地　溫暖地　讓我淚水盈眶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.97,0:23:18.53,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}預感明天也能在此相見
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.53,0:23:22.12,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}不需要約定　去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.12,0:23:26.03,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}像往常一樣若無其事的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.03,0:23:31.34,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}笑著揮動小手
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.31,0:23:36.94,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}{\fad(0,1000)}「那麼…明天見。」
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,TEXT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.55,0:00:04.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收看電視的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.94,0:00:06.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請保持室內明亮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.24,0:00:07.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,並盡量離遠點看哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.81,0:00:09.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好很好  孩子們
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.22,0:00:23.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The Hound  迄今下落不明
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.58,0:00:25.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通信也聯絡不上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.52,0:00:27.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,柏木君  你那邊的狀況如何
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.84,0:00:29.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  已經做好準備了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.84,0:00:31.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.89,0:00:35.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒想到會以這樣的形式和你睡在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.22,0:00:37.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀  不二子真不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.63,0:00:39.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}je t'aime mon amour{\r}\N我愛你  我的愛人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.84,0:00:40.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.16,0:00:42.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,念動下潛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.28,0:02:17.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(730,570)\fad(500,500)}50th  sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.28,0:02:17.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(780,600)\fad(500,500)}「一意奮鬥！Over The Future」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.46,0:02:17.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦  咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.77,0:02:18.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.78,0:02:20.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我應該放進去了的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.80,0:02:23.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會忘記帶教科書的女生根本沒有活著的價值
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.78,0:02:24.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萌度  零
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.01,0:02:25.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼  混帳傢伙！！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.05,0:02:27.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎…怎麼辦…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.29,0:02:29.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道你也沒帶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.69,0:02:30.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.45,0:02:32.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就用這個吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.99,0:02:34.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然滿是塗鴉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.54,0:02:35.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可…可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.55,0:02:37.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣的話  東野君你就…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.17,0:02:39.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事  我會讓旁邊的人分我看的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.72,0:02:41.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也忘記帶了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.12,0:02:44.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一堂課能將位置靠在一起分我看嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.80,0:02:46.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可…可以是可以
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.26,0:02:47.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你該不會是故意的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.10,0:02:49.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了能接近我…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.98,0:02:50.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.87,0:02:52.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話說  你是誰？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.59,0:02:53.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢噢  這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.36,0:02:56.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼接下來
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.68,0:02:59.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最後的修行  勇者滿臉通紅了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.53,0:03:01.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,勇者是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.20,0:03:02.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼會滿臉通紅呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.04,0:03:04.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那…那個…  靠得太近了…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.06,0:03:06.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該能看清楚的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.61,0:03:10.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶  皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.67,0:03:12.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同學真是愉快啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.97,0:03:13.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.85,0:03:15.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感覺真新鮮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.21,0:03:18.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至今為止從沒感覺過皆本距離我這麼近
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.10,0:03:21.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算這是京介製作的幻影
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.73,0:03:23.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算有什麼陰謀呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.07,0:03:24.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.78,0:03:34.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是谷崎先生內心最深的部分…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.89,0:03:37.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒時間了  開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.51,0:03:40.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.34,0:03:43.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫非這是敵人的能力？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.49,0:03:45.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,終於見面了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.42,0:03:47.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來  打起精神來做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.56,0:03:49.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有發現入侵者
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.51,0:03:50.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有發現
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.87,0:03:52.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有發現
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.16,0:03:56.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,繼續開始搜索
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.41,0:04:00.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女王
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.86,0:04:03.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接招  皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.18,0:04:08.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危險  皆本君
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.20,0:04:09.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.30,0:04:11.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  要上了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.36,0:04:13.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等…一…  小薰！！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.18,0:04:14.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小薰！！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.61,0:04:19.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  不要傳球給敵人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.71,0:04:20.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是  可是～
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.56,0:04:22.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才感覺胸口一緊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.39,0:04:22.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少發春！！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.22,0:04:25.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總…總之  反擊了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.32,0:04:25.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.16,0:04:28.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓開  這傢伙由我來解決
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.58,0:04:32.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必殺
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.51,0:04:35.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反動蹴速迅炮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.35,0:04:42.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,犯規啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.97,0:04:44.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧  皆本君
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.96,0:04:45.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.66,0:04:48.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過鼻子的狀態有些不好  鼻血止不住
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.52,0:04:49.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老師  保健室…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.80,0:04:51.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我帶他去保健室…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.01,0:04:53.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我帶他去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.16,0:04:55.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我帶他去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.61,0:04:57.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就知道你們會這樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.21,0:05:01.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還是和我一起去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.46,0:05:24.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃  青椒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.21,0:05:26.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦  你討厭的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.57,0:05:29.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,平時明明總是叫我們不要挑食
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.40,0:05:31.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.37,0:05:33.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大人的皆本是不在意的  加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.00,0:05:35.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是總是這樣對紫穗說的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.50,0:05:37.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像這樣和喜歡的東西一起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.68,0:05:39.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼可愛的我這樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.64,0:05:40.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來  啊～
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.13,0:05:43.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太狡猾了  換我  紫穗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.02,0:05:45.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我嘴對嘴餵你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.82,0:05:47.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.22,0:05:48.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會自己吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.22,0:05:56.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生  了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.90,0:05:59.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃飽了吃飽了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.70,0:06:01.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,東野君  你又這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.59,0:06:02.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒關係的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.86,0:06:03.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.75,0:06:04.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個班級是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.03,0:06:07.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本  快點收拾好去操場吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.26,0:06:14.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎…怎麼了  這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.02,0:06:15.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.87,0:06:20.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡不是我們應該駐留的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.20,0:06:22.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡不是你的班級
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.09,0:06:25.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我知道  但是這是沒辦法的事情啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.89,0:06:26.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只限今天一天
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.90,0:06:29.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯  就算恢復原樣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.63,0:06:33.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等待著你的是在特別教育進程下成長的未來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.73,0:06:34.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.57,0:06:37.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  不要聽信他的話
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.82,0:06:39.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你衷心希望的話
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.81,0:06:43.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼我就會讓這一切不再虛幻  變成真實
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.98,0:06:50.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全刪除你的記憶  我會讓你的身體變成真正的小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.81,0:06:52.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兵部  你要做什麼！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.53,0:06:55.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,將我的生命能源全部使用掉的話\N這並不是不可能的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.21,0:06:55.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.05,0:06:59.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不二子小姐和蒙古醫生正不斷逼近犯人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.17,0:07:03.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掌握將你恢復原樣的方法也只是時間的問題了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.34,0:07:07.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是如果你希望的話  就到屋頂來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.28,0:07:08.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就在那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.56,0:07:11.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能夠一直這個樣子…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.88,0:07:13.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要相信那麼荒唐的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.03,0:07:14.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.96,0:07:16.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.19,0:07:18.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想做個普通的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.82,0:07:23.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像這樣和同齡朋友一起要好地成為大人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.29,0:07:25.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.84,0:07:28.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是  世上沒有徒勞的過去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.78,0:07:30.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為那個時候很傷心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.71,0:07:33.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我們能夠成為薰她們的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.82,0:07:34.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是！！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.85,0:07:38.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  等等
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.82,0:07:42.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了  皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.28,0:07:43.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.55,0:07:45.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫非記憶恢復了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.57,0:07:46.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.42,0:07:49.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,修復進展了不少
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.18,0:07:52.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來是真的在治療啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.38,0:07:55.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼  說謊這種事情少佐…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.48,0:07:56.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偶爾才…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.50,0:07:57.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  才不會呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.99,0:07:58.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.09,0:08:01.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼  晚上會恢復原樣吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.28,0:08:02.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.82,0:08:03.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.48,0:08:03.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.72,0:08:08.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是說我和你們同齡同個班級讓你們覺得很開心嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.97,0:08:10.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃  話是這麼說沒錯…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.95,0:08:11.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.20,0:08:15.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不想恢復原樣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.75,0:08:16.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等…  皆本先生
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.02,0:08:17.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這是怎麼了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.66,0:08:22.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯  既然現在由我自己來選擇的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.58,0:08:27.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀  你終於來了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.38,0:08:30.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我等你很久了哦  皆本君
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.78,0:08:36.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼真正的未來…  我！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.38,0:08:40.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}存分に楽しんでくれたかな{\r}\N有盡情享受嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.99,0:08:44.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}なんかアルバム出るらしいよ{\r}\N好像出專輯了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.96,0:08:45.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}ほんま？{\r}\N真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.59,0:08:46.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}買う買う{\r}\N去買去買
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.41,0:08:50.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎麼說  這也太慢了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.69,0:08:52.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裡面究竟發生了什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.09,0:08:58.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒完沒了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.19,0:09:00.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,管理官  還沒好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.17,0:09:02.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  還差一點
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.07,0:09:07.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此  這傢伙是在黑色幽靈中負責洗腦的…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.90,0:09:10.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,增幅器
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.75,0:09:12.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.36,0:09:14.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Children的三倍增幅的話  可以將這些傢伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.13,0:09:17.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必須要想辦法脫離這裡去通知小薰她們
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.94,0:09:21.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過看來是不會這麼輕易放我們走的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.89,0:09:23.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.31,0:09:25.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼  前段時間逮捕的那幫傢伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.11,0:09:28.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯嗯  似乎和黑色幽靈有所聯繫
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.37,0:09:32.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們似乎收錢承包了那幫傢伙的超能力者偷渡入國
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.88,0:09:36.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前不久有一個人被不知何人引進來的跡象
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.33,0:09:42.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,襲擊皆本君他們是為了報復巴雷特和蒂姆的事件嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.02,0:09:44.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,局…局長
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.46,0:09:47.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼事啊  常盤君  野分君
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.67,0:09:51.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在剛才  大廳…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.31,0:09:54.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我用感應能力中轉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.63,0:09:57.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,局長  是我  明
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.70,0:09:59.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宿木君  你都到哪裡去了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.17,0:10:03.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  我勉強將一部分意識轉移到這傢伙身上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.46,0:10:05.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請趕緊增援
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.30,0:10:06.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她要對小薰她們…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.84,0:10:08.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,振作住  現在在哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.13,0:10:11.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三人的學校的…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.87,0:10:15.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,緊急出動
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.92,0:10:19.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓在附近的隊伍趕往六條院小學
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.44,0:10:21.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本  喂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.56,0:10:24.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的  跑哪去了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.36,0:10:31.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.11,0:10:35.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明石薰  讓我看一下你的記憶吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.56,0:10:40.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真奇怪啊  這個記憶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.10,0:10:42.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本人迄今為止都忘記了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.03,0:10:47.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.57,0:10:49.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這難道是我？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.42,0:10:52.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼會變成大人…  為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.58,0:10:56.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼皆本要對我…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.16,0:10:59.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是女王的真相
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.50,0:11:03.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這孩子是我們超能力者未來的女王？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.41,0:11:06.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紫穗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.34,0:11:07.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有在你那邊嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.88,0:11:09.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有  怎麼一回事了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.95,0:11:12.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生和薰都消失不見了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.99,0:11:15.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,澪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.81,0:11:17.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蛤  誰？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.26,0:11:20.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到剛才還在這個座位上的女人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.54,0:11:21.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起來非常蠢的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.95,0:11:23.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有那樣的女孩啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.44,0:11:24.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那裡不是空位嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.01,0:11:28.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些人看來是開始在著手什麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.25,0:11:28.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.72,0:11:32.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.57,0:11:34.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫我兵部君就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.55,0:11:36.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那件事是說真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.74,0:11:38.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼要為我做到這種程度
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.72,0:11:39.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.04,0:11:42.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就告訴現在的你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.42,0:11:46.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜歡The Children
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.71,0:11:48.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尤其是小薰
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.16,0:11:51.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至可以說是深愛著她
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.63,0:11:54.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明是個小孩  你在說什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.00,0:11:55.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這變態
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.98,0:11:57.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不是小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.17,0:12:00.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且不是這種意思
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.00,0:12:05.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不識趣的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.54,0:12:09.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別人好不容易才下了畢生的決心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.07,0:12:15.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不會讓你們從這裡過去的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.53,0:12:16.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九具津先生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.67,0:12:19.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀  梅枝君  好久不見
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.31,0:12:21.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近和谷崎主任怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.51,0:12:22.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  怎麼回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.75,0:12:24.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對手不是黑色幽靈嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.59,0:12:26.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算是硬闖也要過去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.26,0:12:27.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,念動…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.55,0:12:28.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教育性指導
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.78,0:12:38.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,校規禁止在校內使用失神制壓哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.78,0:12:38.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(768,660)\fs24}Stan Subjection
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.78,0:12:42.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰就是以前的我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.38,0:12:45.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,負傷之前的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.97,0:12:49.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,命中注定總有一天她會走上與我相同的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.23,0:12:53.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你和我都想創建不同的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.96,0:12:57.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我不會原諒背叛我的人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.64,0:13:00.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要將普通人從地球上根除
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.76,0:13:02.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有這個未來不會讓你改變
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.57,0:13:05.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這與我和小薰有什麼關係？！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.74,0:13:11.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道有多少次想要殺死你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.36,0:13:12.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在也是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.63,0:13:13.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很簡單的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.09,0:13:17.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是殺死你的話  女王就活不下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.68,0:13:21.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而就算你活下去了  她也會死的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.07,0:13:22.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.78,0:13:24.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這種命運
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.37,0:13:30.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這個時空  復仇和她的幸福的並存似乎是很困難的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.83,0:13:35.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女王  我…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.77,0:13:38.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在做什麼  悠里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.79,0:13:40.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點給予致命一擊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.60,0:13:44.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,束縛超能力者的\N除了我們黑色幽靈之外不需要其他的人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.72,0:13:46.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父親大人…  可是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.10,0:13:47.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這孩子是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.16,0:13:54.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從小薰身邊離開
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.18,0:14:01.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小薰  沒受傷吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.48,0:14:03.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直美
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.19,0:14:06.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託了  將主任…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.99,0:14:11.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,將你們的皆本先生解救出來…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.98,0:14:12.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直美！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.22,0:14:15.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紫穗  怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.54,0:14:16.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,包在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.38,0:14:18.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算再微小也好  只要能掌握到氣息的話
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.60,0:14:20.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.94,0:14:25.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然搞不太清楚  不過如果我一直是小孩子的話
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.54,0:14:28.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯  一切都將會順利
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.26,0:14:31.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在我能夠將你的大腦完全初始化
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.08,0:14:34.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不會再有這樣的機會了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.64,0:14:36.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.61,0:14:38.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,碰觸這傢伙額頭上的螺絲
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.98,0:14:40.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣的話  你就…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.48,0:14:40.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.29,0:14:42.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小薰
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.34,0:14:44.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女王
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.35,0:14:45.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是京介嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.33,0:14:47.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託了  住手
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.87,0:14:49.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要讓皆本一直這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.06,0:14:53.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是  這是他的願望哦  女王
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.75,0:14:57.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,並不是他會消失  只是變回小孩子而已嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.06,0:14:58.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  可是！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.15,0:15:01.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不只是皆本君的細胞變年輕
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.10,0:15:05.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也有可能因為我的能力的影響而得到微弱的超能力
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.70,0:15:10.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們可以作為同年代的同胞一起生活
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.44,0:15:11.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣的未來也不壞啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.08,0:15:12.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種事情
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.96,0:15:13.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能做到啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.94,0:15:14.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葵  紫穗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.87,0:15:16.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要太小看我哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.52,0:15:19.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要我認真起來  就真的做得到
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.04,0:15:24.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唔  認真起來是怎樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.16,0:15:27.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕是打算用盡自己的生命能源吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.07,0:15:28.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.69,0:15:29.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必須阻止他
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.70,0:15:33.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼  用盡生命能源有什麼問題嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.77,0:15:36.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會死！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.83,0:15:37.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  這是命令
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.10,0:15:39.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說不允許我們出手
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.76,0:15:40.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.34,0:15:41.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.39,0:15:43.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正是少佐嘛  估計馬上就會轉變念頭的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.13,0:15:46.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定是這樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.24,0:15:49.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行的  雖然這樣很愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.70,0:15:51.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然和皆本先生一起很開心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.77,0:15:53.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  這樣是不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.30,0:15:56.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我呢  無視我的心情嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.66,0:15:58.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.67,0:16:02.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重新來過的話  像今天一樣的日子就能持續下去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.22,0:16:06.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,變回大人的話  就沒辦法像那樣和你們做朋友了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.93,0:16:10.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算你們覺得那樣沒問題  但我！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.35,0:16:10.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.45,0:16:15.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算皆本你不用變成小孩  我們也會變成大人追上你的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.80,0:16:19.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小薰  小葵  紫穗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.02,0:16:23.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為你還沒有告訴我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.92,0:16:25.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個時候的回覆
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.78,0:16:29.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個回答我會在見到真正的你的時候說
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.34,0:16:33.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎  那和我約定
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.98,0:16:39.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦  我剛剛在想什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.45,0:16:40.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.91,0:16:44.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不會讓你得逞
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.24,0:16:47.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很礙事啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.53,0:16:54.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什…什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.59,0:16:55.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.47,0:16:56.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑色幽靈
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.71,0:16:58.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.69,0:17:01.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本就是皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.36,0:17:03.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是普通人  大我們十歲
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.60,0:17:06.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總是把我們當成小孩子來對待
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.72,0:17:07.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又笨又溫柔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.05,0:17:10.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本  拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.56,0:17:11.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.39,0:17:12.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信我們
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.25,0:17:15.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要怎麼做  皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.62,0:17:19.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯  我是不能夠忘記的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.09,0:17:22.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們一直是在一起的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.68,0:17:24.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,並且一直在說
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.10,0:17:26.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰  葵  紫穗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.69,0:17:29.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對你們說出這句話
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.62,0:17:30.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本\N皆本先生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.92,0:17:33.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特殊超能力者  The Children
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.25,0:17:35.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三倍增幅  完全解禁
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.56,0:17:40.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,與你度過的必然的每一天
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.46,0:17:42.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,羈絆才不是什麼虛幻
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.75,0:17:44.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,強力凜然振翅高飛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.21,0:17:51.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回來吧  皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.75,0:17:56.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想和原本的皆本  那個皆本在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.61,0:18:00.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.49,0:18:02.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是  小薰！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.35,0:18:08.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是…拯救未來的力量…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.57,0:18:14.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小薰？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.14,0:18:19.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好美
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.39,0:18:26.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.91,0:18:46.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.05,0:18:50.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…  我回來了  大家
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.18,0:18:53.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…  謝謝了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.86,0:18:55.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓你們擔心了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.73,0:19:00.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本  你這傢伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.53,0:19:11.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.69,0:19:13.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想開槍的話  就對我開槍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.49,0:19:15.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果這能夠消除你的憎恨的話
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.95,0:19:17.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你才是  對我開槍如何呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.02,0:19:18.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好機會哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.18,0:19:22.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不吃你這一套  而且…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.50,0:19:29.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不讓你看到我和這些孩子創建的未來的話  我會很困擾的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.83,0:19:32.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要死  兵部
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.63,0:19:35.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,勝負就留到下次機會了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.10,0:19:40.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對於你給予了我這無可替代的一天  我向你道謝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.64,0:19:50.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀呀  又失敗了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.35,0:19:54.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就這麼不擅長誘惑別人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.47,0:19:56.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真木  紅葉  葉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.33,0:19:58.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這可不是開玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.87,0:20:00.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是成功了的話  我們就傷腦筋了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.49,0:20:03.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  居然想將P.A.N.D.R.A.託付給我然後死去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.00,0:20:05.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我可沒有這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.56,0:20:09.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就如此重視那個小鬼嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.43,0:20:12.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  快點走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.05,0:20:14.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢…我還沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.46,0:20:15.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.78,0:20:17.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,託你們的福  最近很開心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.76,0:20:19.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不禁產生了依戀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.87,0:20:21.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本以為這裡就是臨別之地
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.84,0:20:23.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過被甩了  那就沒辦法了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.47,0:20:26.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我盡量活到下一次機會吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.29,0:20:30.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也會思考將女王毫髮無傷地入手的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.11,0:20:33.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以後請收斂這種做法
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.74,0:20:34.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.50,0:20:38.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,決定了跟隨你的我們不就像傻瓜一樣了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.08,0:20:42.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.25,0:20:47.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會謹記於心的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.07,0:20:54.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發現The Hound隊伍了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.35,0:20:56.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了  大家都沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.33,0:20:58.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明  肚子餓了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.45,0:20:59.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生命才是根本啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.07,0:21:02.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初音  有香腸哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.22,0:21:02.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,香腸
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.93,0:21:03.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.70,0:21:07.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我之前究竟…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.19,0:21:09.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來是恢復原樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.56,0:21:11.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼皆本君一定也…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.36,0:21:12.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主任！！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.11,0:21:14.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你醒過來了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.65,0:21:16.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷崎主任
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.32,0:21:18.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道我是誰嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.58,0:21:22.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是做夢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.82,0:21:24.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種事情是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.59,0:21:26.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像這樣的我的直美！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.47,0:21:28.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對我又抽又打的才是我的直美！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.07,0:21:30.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這不是我的直美！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.95,0:21:32.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是柏木
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.32,0:21:33.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任務結束
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.37,0:21:34.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.02,0:21:37.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.60,0:21:38.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這邊也是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.79,0:21:42.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過稍微有點遺憾啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.51,0:21:43.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.26,0:21:45.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小皆本很可愛的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.34,0:21:47.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂喂  不要戲弄大人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.44,0:21:49.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  又把我們當成小孩子來對待
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.82,0:21:51.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話說在前頭  我們！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.78,0:21:57.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  和初次相見時比  是有些成長了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.70,0:22:01.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎  那麼那麼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.30,0:22:03.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰最性感？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.23,0:22:04.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然是我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.42,0:22:05.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.02,0:22:09.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要得意忘形了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.31,0:22:10.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.50,0:22:11.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在等我們
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.52,0:22:13.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別想矇混過關
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.98,0:23:52.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下回的絕對可憐Children是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.44,0:23:54.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何事情都能做到
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.85,0:23:55.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也能到達任何地方
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.61,0:23:57.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.54,0:24:00.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們是最強的超能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.93,0:24:02.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你  皆本先生
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.31,0:24:05.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  我會陪伴在你們身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.12,0:24:08.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到你們長大成人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.62,0:24:09.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永遠…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.55,0:24:11.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐Children
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.48,0:24:14.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最終話  「櫻花浪漫！再會了」
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.11,0:24:17.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐  所以不會輸！

